  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine lamb, Moroccan spice mix, brown sugar, soy sauce, rice vinegar, ginger, garlic, green chilies and onion. Mix well and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "2. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "3. Thread lamb mixture onto skewers.",
    "4. Grill for 8-10 minutes per side, or until lamb is cooked to your liking.",
    "5. Meanwhile, mix glaze ingredients in a small bowl.",
    "6. Brush glaze onto lamb kebabs during last 2 minutes of grilling.",
    "7. Serve hot and garnish with fresh cilantro."
